 # Madeira Dock — implementation handoff, ml2000 (2026-09-25)
+
+## Bounded application arguments (2026-10-17)
+
+The optional `MADEIRA_STEAM_HOST_EXTRA_ARGS` environment variable reaches the
+existing final LaunchApp parameter on initial requests and retries. Missing or
+empty values preserve the prior empty string. Values over 2047 bytes or failed
+environment reads stop with result 45 before launch. Reports never include
+argument contents. The source-built host and runtime audio-client additions
+require physical verification; no game compatibility is asserted by this change.
 
